<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">07092026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Three oil tankers turned back at the Strait of Hormuz this week without a single shot being fired.</s> <s>A radio warning from Iran's navy was enough, because insurers, not warships, decide whether a voyage happens — and a war-risk premium arrives within hours of a threat, long before any missile does.</s> <s>Iran's security chief has now vowed to declare a new prohibited zone in the northern strait, though he hasn't yet said where its boundaries will fall.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A senior American official has said plainly that there may be no nuclear agreement with Iran at all — the very objective the current war was declared to serve.</s> <s>Energy Secretary Chris Wright suggested a deal may have to wait for the next administration, even as strikes continue, and a war that drops its stated goal can only end by exhaustion or by escalation.</s> <s>Iran's programme is knowledge, not buildings, so bombing centrifuge halls resets a clock that inspections were the only instrument ever able to freeze.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>North Korea commissioned its second destroyer in eleven weeks, and Kim Jong Un says another naval milestone follows within eight months.</s> <s>Build rate is the one military statistic that can't be faked in a parade — two hulls that fast means intact yard capacity, steel and skilled welders under the heaviest sanctions regime in the world.</s> <s>Pyongyang's moving warheads from land to sea because a warhead at sea has to be found before it can be destroyed, and nearly everything we know about these ships comes from state media, not independent imagery.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Delhi's municipal corporation has ordered every illegally built structure above four floors in the city sealed, days after a paying-guest house collapsed near the university.</s> <s>A body that can identify and seal those buildings in twenty-four hours could have identified them last month — what was missing wasn't capacity, it was the political cost of not acting.</s> <s>The sealing now evicts the same students whose rooms exist only because licensed housing near Delhi University falls so far short, pushing them further out and no safer.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ursula von der Leyen arrived in Nuuk with an investment package while Washington presses for greater American control of Greenland.</s> <s>Two powers are bidding for the loyalty of fifty-seven thousand people, and neither offer originates with them — Denmark still holds foreign and security policy, while Greenlanders hold a legal right to independence by referendum.</s> <s>The warming that's melting the island's ice is exactly what's opening the Arctic routes and rare-earth deposits that made it worth bidding for.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A UN resolution meant to retire the Mercator projection has been captured by a border dispute within days of passing.</s> <s>Mercator preserves compass bearings for sailors and pays for it by inflating area with distance from the equator, which is why generations have learned that Greenland rivals an Africa fourteen times its size — the Assembly adopted the Equal Earth projection one hundred sixty-four to one.</s> <s>India objects because the new map draws Kashmir inside Chinese and Pakistani borders, and Kashmiris themselves appear in neither government's account as a party.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Five European states plan to send rejected asylum seekers to return hubs outside the union starting next year, borrowing the model Australia built on Nauru.</s> <s>Moving a person off a state's territory is an attempt to move them beyond the courts that would otherwise hear them — the hub is a jurisdictional device before it's a migration one.</s> <s>Australia's version ran more than a decade, cost hundreds of thousands of dollars per person each year, and documented self-harm among children; the five European governments haven't all been named.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Alternative for Germany took forty-four and a half percent in Saxony-Anhalt, its best result anywhere, and still can't form a government.</s> <s>Every rival party has ruled out coalition with it, so the Christian Democrats must now assemble a fragile arrangement of three or four parties to reach a majority.</s> <s>That loop, not this single election, is the structural story — exclusion after victory is the grievance the party runs on next time.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A bus carrying thirty-two people down from the Pico do Fogo volcano plunged into a ravine in Cabo Verde, killing twenty-five.</s> <s>Most of the dead were schoolchildren, on a trip the driver had made every year.</s> <s>Emergency crews searched the ravine overnight.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Ukraine has sent four point eight one billion dollars to its creditors since January, roughly a third of it to the International Monetary Fund.</s> <s>This isn't a paradox but the ordinary architecture of sovereign lending — the Fund's preferred-creditor status is what lets it lend at all, and a state that misses those payments loses every other window at once.</s> <s>Money's fungible, so donor grants arrive and debt payments depart, and the net transfer is far smaller than the headline support figures suggest, from Kyiv to Cairo to Islamabad.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ash from Anak Krakatau grounded about twenty flights between Kuala Lumpur and Jakarta for a second day, with clear skies and an open runway.</s> <s>Volcanic ash is pulverised rock; it melts in a jet engine's roughly fourteen-hundred-degree core, then hardens as glass on the cooler turbine blades behind it until airflow chokes and the engine flames out.</s> <s>There's no filter and no fix — the only control is not flying, which is why one plume closes a whole corridor rather than a single flight.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Around fifty American officials have taken lie-detector tests as the Pentagon hunts for whoever leaked its munitions stockpile figures.</s> <s>The hunt is itself the confirmation — you don't polygraph fifty people over a number that's comfortable.</s> <s>Interceptors come off multi-year production lines with single-source suppliers, so output simply can't surge to match wartime consumption, God willing that gap is never tested further.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India grew seven point eight percent and slipped to the world's sixth-largest economy.</s> <s>Dollar-denominated rankings multiply real growth by domestic inflation by the exchange rate, and only the first of those three is an economy doing better — a table that moves on the third is measuring the dollar.</s> <s>Nothing changed in any Indian household, which is the honest point: a tightening cycle in Washington mechanically demotes the Global South in every league table at once.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nurses across Gauteng have given South Africa's busiest province one month to answer them.</s> <s>Their union cites funded posts left vacant, medicine shortages, and crumbling hospital buildings — staffing gaps that already compromise care.</s> <s>What follows if the deadline passes hasn't been spelled out.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Rural children in eastern Ethiopia carried neglected tropical disease at nearly thirty percent, against fifteen percent in urban slums, in a study of one thousand and forty-eight children.</s> <s>These are diseases of water, sanitation and soil contact rather than contagion, and the standard control programme delivers drugs through rural schools on the assumption that they're village diseases.</s> <s>Single site, cross-sectional, and still awaiting its version of record — but the targeting rule, not the drug, is what the finding puts in question.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Roughly a million young Britons are neither working nor studying, and researchers have now linked that status to social isolation in childhood.</s> <s>Most vacancies travel through loose acquaintances rather than close family — people who move in different circles and know things you don't — so an isolated teenager sits outside the channel jobs actually move through.</s> <s>The work is observational and isolation travels with disadvantage, but early unemployment scars earnings for decades, which means isolation at sixteen shows up in income at forty.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers in London can now read an immune cell's metabolism from the faint light its own chemistry emits.</s> <s>Energy-carrying molecules inside every cell glow on their own, and that glow shifts measurably between a resting cell and a working one — no dye, no stain, just an ordinary blood draw of the kind already banked worldwide.</s> <s>It still needs testing against established methods before anyone reaches for those banks.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Autistici Inventati, the Italian collective that ran email and hosting for activists, unions and journalists for twenty-five years, is shutting down.</s> <s>Independent mail is nearly impossible to run at small scale, because the large providers' spam-reputation systems silently discard messages from tiny senders — consolidation here is enforced by filtering, not chosen by users.</s> <s>The collective says it was designated a global terrorist organisation, making continued operation a legal risk to the very people it protected; backup instructions are posted.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Roughly four thousand bitcoin drained out of the Liquid Network, and Blockstream blames a software bug rather than a stolen key.</s> <s>That inverts the usual story: key custody, hardware modules, multisig ceremonies — none of it engaged, because the code deciding which transactions are valid decided wrongly.</s> <s>A balance on Liquid was never bitcoin, it's a claim on a federation of named companies, and the attackers describe themselves as white-hats, a claim worth nothing until funds return.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Isar Aerospace reached orbit from Andøya, the first rocket ever to do so from Western European soil.</s> <s>Its debut flight crashed last year after a vent valve opened and the vehicle lost attitude control; this one deployed five cubesats after a circularization burn.</s> <s>Europe has launched for decades from South America — this is the first time it hasn't had to.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A plumber's photographs identified a secret aerospace mockup parked at Long Beach.</s> <s>Registration filings, ownership shells and airport permits each leak a fragment, and spotters piece the fragments together faster than any classification regime anticipated.</s> <s>Paper trails, not clearances, now set the boundary of what stays hidden.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>